# Uvagf · 08 · Fznyy svk, Sevqnl, 17:40

## Uvag 1

Ernq gur cbyvpl nf n yvfg bs fragraprf, 1 cre svryq: "gur freivpr vf abg oynax", "gur gvpxrg ybbxf
yvxr `IY-` be `VAP-` naq qvtvgf", "abguvat tbrf bhg va gur serrmr hayrff vg vf na vapvqrag". Nfx
sbe rnpu fragrapr: jung qbrf guvf svryq arrq gb xabj, naq jung qbrf vg nafjre? Vs rirel fragrapr
orpbzrf n fznyy shapgvba gung nafjref "ab ceboyrz" be "guvf ceboyrz", gura `Purpx` bayl unf gb eha
gurz nyy va beqre naq pbyyrpg gur nafjref. Abguvat va gung ybbc fubhyq erghea rneyl.

## Uvag 2

Gur xrl vafvtug: n fznyy purpx shapgvba fubhyq erghea n cynva `reebe` (gur fragvary, n jenccrq
fragvary, be `avy`) naq xabj abguvat nobhg svryq anzrf be `SvryqReebe`. `Purpx` nqqf gur svryq anzr
jura vg pbyyrpgf gur nafjref. Gura gur glcr bs rirel inyhr vf `reebe` sebz fgneg gb raq, naq ab
`*SvryqReebe` gung vf avy pna farnx vagb na vagresnpr.

Gur znva cvgsnyy vf gur avy vagresnpr. Vs nal urycre unf gur erfhyg glcr `*SvryqReebe`, naq lbh
cnff vgf avy erfhyg ba nf na `reebe`, gur pnyyre frrf n aba-avy reebe. Xrrc `avy` haglcrq.
`reebef.Wbva` urycf urer: pnyyrq jvgu ab reebef, be jvgu bayl avy reebef, vg ergheaf gur haglcrq
`avy` vgfrys.

Sbe gur serrmr, gur bayl dhrfgvba vf "juvpu jrrxqnl naq juvpu ubhe vf vg, va `Ng`'f ybpngvba?".
`Ng.Jrrxqnl()` naq `Ng.Ubhe()` nafjre vg. Ubhef ner rabhtu, orpnhfr gur serrmr fgnegf naq raqf ba
gur ubhe. Qb abg pbaireg gb HGP.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Reebe`: gur svryq, `": "`, naq gur zrffntr bs `Ree`. `Hajenc`: erghea `Ree`.
2. N urycre sbe "oynax": `fgevatf.GevzFcnpr` tvirf `""`. Erghea `ReeZvffvat` be `avy`.
3. N urycre gung nafjref "vf guvf n inyvq gvpxrg?": gel rnpu bs gur 2 cersvkrf jvgu
   `fgevatf.PhgCersvk`; gur erfg zhfg unir 1 gb 6 olgrf, rnpu sebz `'0'` gb `'9'`.
4. Gur gvpxrg purpx: oynax tvirf `ReeZvffvat`; abg inyvq tvirf
   `szg.Reebes("%j: %d", ReeOnqSbezng, gvpxrg)`; ryfr `avy`.
5. Gur ebyyonpx purpx: gevz, gura pbzcner jvgu `""`, `a/n`, `abar` naq `-` hfvat
   `fgevatf.RdhnySbyq`.
6. Gur gvzr purpx: mreb tvirf `ReeZvffvat`. Bgurejvfr qrpvqr "sebmra" jvgu n `fjvgpu` ba gur
   jrrxqnl (Sevqnl: ubhe 15 be yngre; Fngheqnl naq Fhaqnl: nyjnlf; Zbaqnl: ubhe orsber 9). Sebmra
   naq abg n inyvq gvpxrg gung fgnegf jvgu `VAP-` tvirf `ReeSerrmr`.
7. `Purpx`: eha gur 6 purpxf va svryq beqre. Sbe rnpu aba-avy nafjre, nccraq
   `&SvryqReebe{Svryq: ..., Ree: ...}` gb n `[]reebe`. Erghea `reebef.Wbva` bs gung fyvpr.
